          "label": "a",
          "text": "\\(2\\sqrt{2}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "\\(12\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "\\(3\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(\\sqrt{2}\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "b",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(\\dfrac{x^2}{18}-\\dfrac{y^2}{18}=1\\Rightarrow a^2=b^2=18\\)\n\\(c^2=a^2+b^2=36\\Rightarrow c=6\\)\nউপকেন্দ্রদ্বয়ের দূরত্ব \\(=2c=12\\)",
