      "answer": "b",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(e^2=1+\\dfrac{b^2}{a^2}=1+\\dfrac45=\\dfrac95\\Rightarrow e=\\dfrac3{\\sqrt5}\\)\nনিয়ামক \\(y=\\pm\\dfrac ae=\\pm\\dfrac{\\sqrt5\\cdot\\sqrt5}{3}=\\pm\\dfrac53\\)\nদূরত্ব \\(=\\dfrac{10}{3}\\)",
