    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch6-mcq-013",
      "text": "\\(x + y + c = 0\\) সরলরেখাটি \\(y^2 = x\\) পরাবৃত্তটিকে স্পর্শ করলে c এর মান কত?",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "\\(-4\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "\\(-\\dfrac{1}{4}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{1}{4}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(4\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "c",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(y=-x-c\\) কে \\(y^2=x\\) এ বসিয়ে \\(x^2+(2c-1)x+c^2=0\\)\nস্পর্শক হলে নিশ্চায়ক \\(=0\\): \\((2c-1)^2-4c^2=1-4c=0\\Rightarrow c=\\dfrac14\\)",
      "source": {
        "board": "CUB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 22,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch6-mcq-014",
      "text": "\\(y^2 = 4x + 3y - 7\\) পরাবৃত্তটির উপকেন্দ্রিক লম্বের দৈর্ঘ্য—",
