        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "16",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "কোনোটি নয়",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "a",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(y^2-3y=4x-7\\Rightarrow\\left(y-\\dfrac32\\right)^2=4x-\\dfrac{19}{4}=4\\left(x-\\dfrac{19}{16}\\right)\\)\nএখানে \\(4a=4\\), উপকেন্দ্রিক লম্বের দৈর্ঘ্য \\(=4\\)",
      "source": {
